# Power BI Sales Dashboard

## Project Overview

This is an interactive Sales Dashboard built using Microsoft Power BI that analyzes business performance across different regions and product categories.

The dashboard helps understand total revenue, regional sales contribution, product category performance, and discount impact on sales.

---

## Key Features

- Total Sales KPI: ₹1,91,300 overall revenue
- Regional breakdown: West (25%), North (22%), South (18%), East (14%)
- Category analysis: Electronics (₹85,000), Furniture (₹65,000), Clothing (₹41,000)
- Calculated Total Sales using formula: Quantity × Unit Price × (1 - Discount)
- Interactive filters to slice data by region and category

---

